{"id":"5c4afc9766080d5a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-hardcore-predicate.md","title":"df-hardcore-predicate (Hard-Core Predicate)","display":"df-hardcore-predicate (Hard-Core Predicate)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-hardcore-predicate (Hard-Core Predicate)","label":"28-df-hardcore-predicate","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-hardcore-predicate","Hard-Core Predicate","Hardcore Predicate"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-one-way-function]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_book_location":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.12 context; printed p.183; PDF p.209","source_printed_pages":"183","source_pdf_pages":"209","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hardcore-predicate (Hard-Core Predicate)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-hardcore-predicate"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-hardcore-predicate</span><span>Hard-Core Predicate</span><span>Hardcore Predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§9.3.2 Theorem 9.12 context; printed p.183; PDF p.209"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"183"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"209"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 与单比特串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 认同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{OWF}\">\\(\\mathbf{OWF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 为均匀的一比特输出预测器，输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1^n,f(x))\">\\((1^n,f(x))\\)</span>，二输入采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a> 的已定义配对接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^n\">\\(\\Sigma^n\\)</span> 上均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的随机性独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 上概率质量函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\">\\(\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\)</span> 为下式定义的一比特输出预测器子类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)\">\\(\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)\\)</span> 为硬核谓词关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(p)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:p(z)&gt;0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{supp}(p)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:p(z)&gt;0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}:\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\operatorname{supp}(A(z))\\subseteq\\{\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}:\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\operatorname{supp}(A(z))\\subseteq\\{\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}[A(1^n,f(x))=h(x)]-\\tfrac12\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}[A(1^n,f(x))=h(x)]-\\tfrac12\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}\\land h\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}\\land h\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>预测器与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76af324ae3acb27e\" href=\"?note=76af324ae3acb27e\" title=\"28-df-one-way-function\">28-df-one-way-function</a> 的逆算法使用相同的显式安全参数，避免一般非保长函数中两个安全接口不一致。绝对优势同时排除正、负相关；对预测器输出取补可把负相关变成正相关。第 9.3.2 节具体使用随机内积硬核位，本节点把该性质抽成可复用接口，不把扩展函数的编码隐藏在定义中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-one-way-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 与单比特串 $\\langle b\\rangle$ 认同；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]，$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$ 与单比特串 $\\langle b\\rangle$ 认同；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]，$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀的一比特输出预测器，输入为 $(1^n,f(x))$，二输入采用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的已定义配对接口；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]；$U_n$ 为 $\\Sigma^n$ 上均匀分布，$A$ 的随机性独立于 $x$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀的一比特输出预测器，输入为 $(1^n,f(x))$，二输入采用 [[28-df-ppt]] 的已定义配对接口；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]；$U_n$ 为 $\\Sigma^n$ 上均匀分布，$A$ 的随机性独立于 $x$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-one-way-function","status":"resolved","id":"76af324ae3acb27e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"预测器与 [[28-df-one-way-function]] 的逆算法使用相同的显式安全参数，避免一般非保长函数中两个安全接口不一致。绝对优势同时排除正、负相关；对预测器输出取补可把负相关变成正相关。第 9.3.2 节具体使用随机内积硬核位，本节点把该性质抽成可复用接口，不把扩展函数的编码隐藏在定义中。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{OWF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"(1^n,f(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}:\\mathbb N\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(p)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\Sigma^*:p(z)>0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}:\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\operatorname{supp}(A(z))\\subseteq\\{\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr_{x\\leftarrow U_n}[A(1^n,f(x))=h(x)]-\\tfrac12\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HardCore}(h,f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\in\\mathbf{OWF}\\land h\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{PredAdv}_{A,f,h}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.","display":true}],"bytes":2260,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基础安全概念：[[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-negl]]、[[28-df-one-way-function]]、[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]、[[28-df-prg]]、[[28-df-prf]]。"},{"id":"bc4db49d023a67c9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PredPPT}_{01}$ 是 [[28-df-hardcore-predicate]] 的一比特输出预测器类；$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。$\\langle b\\rangle\\in\\Sigma^1$ 为由比特 $b$ 组成的单字符字串，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；概率同时包括 $A$ 的独立随机性。"}],"outgoing":["f3171800627deef3","b75200f005282ddf","76af324ae3acb27e","adb92775ec020a0b"]}